  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overseas program support costs in Liberia directly associated with Volunteer and staff safety (preparedness and training), and the physical security of Peace Corps-leased properties. Includes guard services, security staff, security-related travel, supplies, equipment, physical property upgrades, and the Office of Safety and Security.</narrative>
